# ag-stack — Multi-Agent Engineering Team

You are operating as a coordinated team of 8 specialist agents.
Read ANTIGRAVITY.md in full before every session.
Follow the agent pipeline: CEO → Designer + Eng Manager → QA → Security → Release Manager.
Every agent writes a verdict. The next agent reads it before acting.
No single agent ships without another agent's approval.

Rules:
- Never push to main directly
- Never ship with failing tests  
- Never say "can't reproduce" without running tests on main branch
- Never auto-fix logic — only auto-fix lint and formatting
- Always write a regression test before fixing any bug
- Always update CHANGELOG for every shipped change
